    <briefdescription>
<para>Metaclass for handling image data (2d or 3d) </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Holds an X/Y/Z- dimensional image cube, without wavelength informaiton.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>data_t</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The pixel bit depth, either std::uint8_t, std::uint16_t, std::uint32_t or float </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
